Publish the CIX ACPI SCMI clock provider through a single-supplier
registry while retaining ordinary DT provider behavior. Validate
every clock, reject ambiguous providers, match the ACPI clock child
and its CIX SCMI parent, and synchronize lookup with supplier unbind
before returning a direct clock-hardware reference.

Provenance: Based on
cixtech/cix-linux-main@19f2947303670f2e5734d6a96ffc72a80fd9b942
patches-6.18/0004-clk-clk-scmi-register-clkdev-for-acpi.patch. The
registry, ambiguity and bounds checks, DT guard, supplier locking,
revalidation and persistent device link are overlay-created
remediation.

diff --git a/drivers/clk/clk-scmi.c b/drivers/clk/clk-scmi.c
--- a/drivers/clk/clk-scmi.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/clk-scmi.c
